# The monorepo root .gitignore is Python-oriented (ignores *.json, *.png, etc.).
# Re-include the config/asset types this Next.js app needs so hub/ stays buildable
# after cloning. (Private scripts/*.json, *.csv stay ignored — scripts/ is excluded above.)
!*.json
!*.png
